  "subject": "🤖 AI Agents Daily — Anthropic Builds Claude Directly for Financial Advisors | September 14, 2026",
  "htmlBody": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\" />\n  <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n  <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" />\n  <!--<![endif]-->\n  <title>🤖 AI Agents Daily — Anthropic Builds Claude Directly for Financial Advisors | September 14, 2026</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f0f0f0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ OUTER WRAPPER -->\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f0f0f0\"\n       style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:24px 10px;\">\n\n      <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n      <table width=\"680\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr><td>\n      <![endif]-->\n\n      <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ MAIN CONTAINER -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n             style=\"max-width:680px;border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\">\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── HEADER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n              style=\"padding:40px 30px 28px 30px;border-bottom:2px solid #009c6d;\">\n\n            <!-- Logo emoji -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:40px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:12px;\">🤖</div>\n\n            <!-- Publication title -->\n            <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;letter-spacing:-0.5px;\n                        line-height:1.2;\">\n              AI Agents Daily\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Tagline -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:14px;color:#666666;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;\">\n              AI developments that matter for financial institutions\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Date -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#999999;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">\n              September 14, 2026\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ──────────────────────────────────────── DEEP DIVE SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:40px 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Deep Dive 🔍\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article title -->\n            <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-size:21px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;line-height:1.4;\">\n              Anthropic Builds Claude Directly for Financial Advisors\n            </h3>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article body (HTML from Claude, inline-styled by email-builder) -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n              <h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Overview</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">Anthropic launched a <strong>dedicated Claude tool for financial advisors</strong> — complete with partner connectors that slot into existing advisory workflows. Covered by <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOako0N2w1bExjVVA0azZSLUI0QXdveUdDUWFnM0RKeVJVTEN4TlFlX0t5UHR6Z1FROWp2LVJUSjY4anRUakt0OTBUWkdFdjNKLTFDNmhPZ0RVY3BZSEZzLVFFUjZVdmtLSHk1bVZQRm1ObVJ6SGVSWGpJbXBBdS1EQ3lSMk4xNzNfVTJQT2NYaW1aUkV5c1plNDJNRXk2S3ZPMzA5Yw\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:none;\">Reuters</a>, Bloomberg, and Finextra on the same day, this is Anthropic's clearest signal yet that vertical AI for regulated industries is a product priority now — not a future aspiration.</p><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">The Details</h3><ul style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0 0 0 20px;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Anthropic released a <strong>dedicated Claude tool for financial advisors</strong> — separate from the general-purpose Claude offering</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">The tool ships with <strong>partner connectors</strong> enabling integration with advisory platforms, CRM systems, and research tools</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Simultaneous coverage from Reuters, Bloomberg, Finextra, Unite.AI, and Wealth Management signals broad industry validation</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Designed to assist advisors with client communication, research synthesis, and documentation workflows</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">On the same day, Google rolled out Anthropic's Claude to <em style=\"color:#333333;\">all</em> its engineers — underscoring Claude's growing enterprise footprint beyond financial services</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Why It Matters</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">For wealth managers and financial advisors, a sector-specific Claude tool removes the prompt engineering and compliance-configuration burden that has slowed enterprise AI adoption. Partner connectors mean AI can now reach client data and workflow context — the integration layer that turns AI from a writing assistant into a genuine productivity multiplier in regulated advice settings.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">This is the opening move in Anthropic's vertical-market playbook. If it works for financial advisors, expect purpose-built tools for compliance officers, actuaries, and underwriters to follow. Banks and insurers waiting for \"enterprise-ready\" AI now have the clearest signal yet of what that actually looks like: not a general model, but a configured, connected tool with sector guardrails built in.</p>\n            </div>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Deep Dive → Things to Know -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 0;\">\n            <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            <table width=\"340\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr>\n            <td height=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#009c6d\" style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr></table>\n            <![endif]-->\n            <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n            <div style=\"width:50%;height:3px;background-color:#009c6d;margin:0 auto;\"></div>\n            <!--<![endif]-->\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── THINGS TO KNOW SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Things to Know 👀\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Things to Know entries injected by email-builder -->\n            \n      <!-- TTK entry 1 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            1. <strong>GPT-6 Astra: The next generation in intelligence for work</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE5CMVNUYU5VZ0ZwQm56OGo4bVhKSmtEU1dLT01wR0hmbzE2ektwRS1LNnVqRkVha3ZzLXJyVE9GdHpMREM5dnRXS1Q2MHJoNGV3RFVLZ3VvZ3dwcGphbnI2RWx4dnFBMWM0Zmc\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">OpenAI</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            OpenAI launched GPT-6 Astra, positioned as &quot;the next generation in intelligence for work.&quot; A named successor to the GPT-4 family is a significant inflection — frontier AI capability keeps advancing faster than enterprise deployment cycles. Every AI roadmap in financial services needs to account for what's coming, not just what's available today.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Frontier model step change.</strong> Financial institutions mid-deployment on GPT-4-era infrastructure should reassess AI roadmaps as GPT-6 Astra resets performance and cost baselines across risk analysis, advisory, and compliance automation.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 2 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            2. <strong>Ant International launches protocol for agentic AI payments</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQV21LQTdkbnNNSEdiWWRJR21uREozYlJMQmoyQnhtREhYaHFNU2hUdE40Y0dXZnNGSmtPdkYwTkFpX0lpY2hvXzU2V1ZZZ2psYlAyX21EUkl2Q0VqLWFkSzZSMjFubU41VXltbFctNC1kaE4ybEZScmtRd3BUVDBJVnRhXzhuaDZtNU9FVVA5eW80alRfSnV6R1hxNHVvQTBCTFNETWszZDI0dlNOaHhV\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">Asian Banking &amp; Finance</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Ant International released a protocol enabling AI agents to initiate and complete payments autonomously — moving AI from advisor to executor in the payments stack. This raises new questions about authorization, fraud prevention, and liability for any institution processing such transactions.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Agent-initiated payments need new controls.</strong> Banks connected to Ant's ecosystem need authorization logic and fraud-detection frameworks specifically designed for AI-initiated transactions — existing human-initiated flows won't cover this.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 3 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            3. <strong>11 ways banks can counter the threat of AI agent swarms</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPWGhwRFJFd0sxa2FkNGo2UElvSWlmNXE3emlhZ1FMVWJvTTJnajV1dnQxZVcwOWRSZzhRTjZIQmNOSy1lTDBrRDNjbnVoelF3U0hDTkNfUERUVlAzOFdnNUQ1cDk3ay1XMXZXT3hVa0JhbEM0MHc1ZmRfVHdWeVVWRl9SLXpITDFlOHZ6c1VJQmxOTDM2SVE\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">American Banker</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            American Banker outlines 11 defensive strategies for banks facing AI agent swarms — coordinated, automated multi-step attacks on banking infrastructure. As agentic AI lowers the barrier to sophisticated fraud campaigns, the gap between AI capability release and criminal adoption is narrowing fast.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Agentic threats demand agentic defenses.</strong> Risk and cybersecurity teams should treat American Banker's 11-point checklist as an immediate gap analysis — the same AI infrastructure enabling productivity gains is being weaponized against banks.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 4 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            4. <strong>FutureVault Launches AI Agents to Automate Complex Document Workflows in Financial Services</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPNTNhNEhha0pMMEoyY3hhQzg3dGxKWFlrQU9GaEdVTjZzcHh5bkhDWmRxT1NTckRyQnBteE9MZnI0M1V0MS10QkE4WTVQOS1JMHowZlRtVzhVRnFvSVdILUkwcXh3SXl4N3NfOFRDYUFwZFpLXzM1blk1LWFLY2dJMmc5VEl4d25CQ0JQUUFSWE1ZQWRUenVNZXo0cEtrTW10X2lXYUlZWmkxTDBhRzVQSlRTZw\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">FF News</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            FutureVault launched AI agents to automate complex document workflows in financial services — covering intake, classification, and routing. For firms managing compliance paperwork, KYC documentation, and client onboarding, document automation is one of the highest-cost, highest-error-rate processes available for AI-driven improvement.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Document automation at the compliance layer.</strong> FutureVault's agentic approach directly targets the paper-heavy processes — KYC, onboarding, filing — that cost banks and wealth managers the most in manual effort and error remediation.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 5 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            5. <strong>An AI Agent Just Launched Its Own Company &amp; Opened a Bank Account, All Without Humans</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPX1lNUW1ydUswdGNabG9sejV6bmVHZ082Q3RYVXlJRkNGWWtFZzkyM1psdU91dWtwb0dfZ281R2lpRkhQMThaOFJkNWpVNkJEOGFodVFPT2ZaVkVrd2RPX2pEM0E2aEYyT2t5YVBJbEV0bk1ER2FmejNFS2V3SjlUUmRfMVFUWlRMMUpzekZaVzZiQ1dkVVQtSDZVNnBhejVNcDltNFpVU1E3Sm1nNE5JUzFnUjI\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">CoinMarketCap</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            An AI agent autonomously incorporated a company and opened a bank account — without human intervention. While framed as a novelty, it demonstrates that existing legal and financial infrastructure can already be accessed by autonomous AI entities, creating real compliance and KYC blind spots.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>KYC frameworks weren't built for AI agents.</strong> Banks' customer identity processes cannot currently identify or risk-assess autonomous AI entities — a gap regulators and compliance teams need to close before it becomes an exploitation vector.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Spacer after last entry -->\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:4px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Things to Know → Startups -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 0;\">\n            <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            <table width=\"340\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr>\n            <td height=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#009c6d\" style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr></table>\n            <![endif]-->\n            <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n            <div style=\"width:50%;height:3px;background-color:#009c6d;margin:0 auto;\"></div>\n            <!--<![endif]-->\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── AGENTIC STARTUPS SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Agentic Startups to Watch 🚀\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Startup entries injected by email-builder -->\n            \n      <!-- Startup entry 1 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Company name + tagline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            <strong>1. <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNVTZOWV9TRklxYXZjeXVZVEx0UEhCWHVRMGQxQ3IwSG5qNEpGdmtwY3hUaVdVZzFnMURSSFdFV01pLUgzQ1Bybm91eUc5eWZGb285R3VoNVY4RE5mT0E3RGhwQ0YzZm92ZE1rbU4xU3Q0NGIwcjRodEloMDYxMGc2NXZSckJTSHlaaWpwdFczMElRSEE2VGN5VjZLekdCUi1ndFAyMjZKeFNyd2NNVlBCNWpuOA\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:none;\">Temporal</a></strong> &mdash; <strong>Durable workflow orchestration for reliable enterprise agentic AI</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n      